  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "3 metal detectors on the beach to have a look at which is the better, the Seahunter and Garrett ATX are both <a href=\"@crawfords-metal-detectors/\" data-kind=\"internal\">Pulse Induction Detectors</a> and the <a href=\"@\" data-kind=\"internal\">CTX3030</a> is a multi frequency detector, all 3 performed ok (ish) as the beach has alot of iron scrap on it, did manage to find a viccy halfpenny and a clip of live .303 rounds from the war."
